        "text": "\u3046\u308F\u3042\u2026\u2026\u7B4B\u8089\u306B\u3082\u52C9\u5F37\u304C\u5FC5\u8981\u306A\u306E\uFF01\uFF1F\n\u52C9\u5F37\u306F\u982D\u304C\u3053\u3046\u3001\u308F\u3042\u3042\u3042\u3063\u3066\u306A\u3063\u3066\n\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\u306B\u306A\u308B\u304B\u3089\u5ACC\u306A\u306E\u306B\u30FC",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaat... Even muscles need studying!?\nStudying makes my head go all fuzzy\nand I can\u0027t take anymore\u2014"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u6642\u9593\u3092\u935B\u932C\u306B\u56DE\u3057\u305F\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u306A\u3042\u3002\n\u3067\u3082\u3001\u3053\u308C\u3082\u9A0E\u58EB\u8A66\u9A13\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u304B\u3042",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d rather spend that time training.\nBut I guess it\u0027s like the knight exam all over again"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u8A66\u9A13\u52C9\u5F37\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\u7B4B\u8089\u52C9\u5F37\u3082\n\u3053\u308C\u304B\u3089\u306F\u3057\u3066\u3044\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3068\u306D\u3002\n\u7B4B\u8089\u7B4B\u8089\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027ll have to study muscles along with my exam prep.\nMuscles, muscles!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u308B\u306E\u3082\u7D0D\u5F97\u3060\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No wonder you\u0027re getting stronger!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3093\u3002\u5B9F\u611F\u304C\u4F34\u3063\u3066\u308B\u3088\u3002\n\u7B4B\u8089\u304C\u305F\u304E\u3063\u3066\u308B\u306E\u3092\u611F\u3058\u308B\u3082\u3093\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah, I can really feel it!\nMy muscles are burning with energy!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u307E\u3060\u307E\u3060\u2026\u2026\uFF01\n\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306E\u7B4B\u8089\u3061\u3083\u3093\u305F\u3061\u306F\n\u3082\u3063\u3068\u9811\u5F35\u308C\u308B\u3063\u3066\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u308B\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But it\u0027s not enough...!\nMy muscles are telling me\nthey can work even harder!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EA\u30E9\u3055\u3093\u306B\u306F\u304B\u306A\u308F\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3082\u3001\n\u305B\u3081\u3066\u8FFD\u3044\u3064\u304B\u306A\u3044\u3068\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I might not match up to Lila,\nbut I\u0027ve got to at least catch up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\uFF08\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u2026\u2026\u304B\u3063\u3053\u3044\u3044\u306A\uFF09",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Izana... you\u0027re so cool)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30C3\u30B5\u30FC\u30B8\u3059\u308B\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let me give you a massage!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30DE\u30C3\u30B5\u30FC\u30B8\u3059\u308B\u3088\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01\n\u7B4B\u8089\u304C\u5F35\u3063\u3066\u308B\u304B\u3089\u3001\u307B\u3050\u3057\u3066\u3044\u304F\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let me give you a massage, Izana!\nYour muscles are all tense, I\u0027ll help loosen them up"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u307E\u305A\u306F\u811A\u304B\u3089\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Starting with your legs...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3063\u3002\u3048\u3063\u3001\u3061\u3087\u3063\u3068\u5F85\u3063\u3066\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah! W-wait a second!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304F\u3059\u3050\u3063\u305F\u3044\u2026\u2026\u3042\u306F\u306F\u306F\u306F\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That tickles... ahahahaha!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3082\u3046\uFF01\u3000\u30C0\u30E1\u3060\u3063\u3066\u3070\u30FC\u30FC\u30FC\u30FC\u30FC\uFF01\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Stop! I can\u0027t take it\u2014!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\uFF01\u3000\u5927\u4E08\u592B\uFF01\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana! Are you okay!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3046\u3001\u3046\u3093\u2026\u2026\u5927\u5909\u3060\u3063\u305F\u3041",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-yeah... that was intense..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3068\u306B\u304B\u304F\u3001\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u306F\u3082\u3063\u3068\u3082\u3063\u3068\n\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u308B\u304B\u3089\u697D\u3057\u307F\u306B\u3057\u3066\u3066\u306D\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Anyway, I\u0027m going to keep getting stronger\nso look forward to it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u660E\u65E5\u306F\u8AB0\u304B\u306B\u624B\u5408\u308F\u305B\u3092\u304A\u9858\u3044\u3057\u3088\u3046\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Maybe I\u0027ll ask someone to spar with me tomorrow"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u3055\u3059\u304C\u306B\u3001\u6839\u3092\u8A70\u3081\u3059\u304E\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u304B\u306A",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Aren\u0027t you pushing yourself too hard?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3048\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u672C\u306B\u66F8\u3044\u3066\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I read it in a book..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u7B4B\u8089\u306F\u3001\u935B\u3048\u305F\u3068\u304D\u3058\u3083\u306A\u304F\u3066\n\u4F11\u606F\u6642\u306B\u3053\u305D\u767A\u9054\u3059\u308B\u3093\u3060\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Muscles actually develop during rest periods,\nnot during training"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u3001\u30EA\u30E9\u3055\u3093\u306B\u6559\u3048\u3066\u3082\u3089\u3063\u305F\u3053\u3068\u3068\n\u9055\u3063\u305F\u3089\u6C17\u306B\u3057\u306A\u304F\u3066\u3044\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3051\u3069\u2026\u2026\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ah, but if that\u0027s different from what Lila taught you,\ndon\u0027t worry about it...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u2026\u2026\u5FC3\u914D\u3057\u3066\u304F\u308C\u3066\u3001\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Thanks for worrying about me"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u3051\u3069\u3001\u30EA\u30E9\u3055\u3093\u304C\u8A00\u3063\u3066\u305F\u3093\u3060\n\u932C\u91D1\u8853\u58EB\u3068\u5171\u306B\u5728\u308D\u3046\u3068\u3059\u308B\u306E\u306F\u5927\u5909\u3063\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But Lila told me that being with an alchemist\ncan be really challenging"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u304D\u3063\u3068\u3001\u30A2\u30F3\u30DA\u30EB\u3068\u306E\u65C5\u3067\n\u3044\u304F\u3064\u3082\u306E\u56F0\u96E3\u304C\u3042\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u308D\u3046\u306D",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She must have faced lots of difficulties\nwhile traveling with Empel"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u30A2\u30BF\u30B7\u3082\u3001\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3092\u5B88\u308B\u305F\u3081\u306B\n\u5F37\u304F\u306A\u3089\u306A\u304D\u3083\u3063\u3066\u899A\u609F\u3092\u6C7A\u3081\u305F\u306E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That\u0027s why I\u0027m determined to get stronger\u2014\nso I can protect you"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u306E\u305F\u3081\u306E\u935B\u932C\u306F\u82E6\u3058\u3083\u306A\u3044\u3057\u3001\n\u884C\u3051\u308B\u5834\u6240\u304C\u5E83\u304C\u3063\u3066\u3001\u5B09\u3057\u3044\u3093\u3060\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The training doesn\u0027t feel like a burden,\nand I\u0027m happy that I can go to more places now"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u2026\u2026\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana... thank you"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3060\u304B\u3089\u306D\u3001\u4F9D\u983C\u304C\u4E00\u6BB5\u843D\u3057\u305F\u3089\n\u3069\u3053\u3078\u3060\u3063\u3066\u9023\u308C\u3066\u3044\u304F\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Once we\u0027re done with our current requests,\nI\u0027ll take you anywhere!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u884C\u304D\u305F\u3044\u5834\u6240\u3001\u3042\u308B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Is there somewhere you want to go?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u306B\u805E\u3053\u3046",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s ask your hammer"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u306B\u805E\u3053\u3046\uFF01\n\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3082\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3068\u4E00\u7DD2\u306B\n\u9811\u5F35\u3063\u305F\u3093\u3060\u304B\u3089\u3001\u610F\u898B\u3092\u805E\u304B\u306A\u304F\u3061\u3083",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let\u0027s ask your hammer!\nIt\u0027s worked so hard with you,\nwe should hear its opinion too"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u308A\u304C\u3068\u3046\u3002\u304D\u3063\u3068\u559C\u3076\u3088",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks. I\u0027m sure it\u0027ll be happy"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u3058\u3083\u3001\u8033\u3092\u6F84\u307E\u305B\u3066\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, let\u0027s listen carefully..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3055\u3093\u3001\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\u3055\u3093\u3002\n\u3069\u3053\u306B\u884C\u304D\u305F\u3044\u3067\u3059\u304B\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mr. Hammer, Mr. Hammer.\nWhere would you like to go?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30B1\u30FC\u30AD\u30E4\u30B5\u30F3\u30CB\u2026\u2026\u30A4\u30AD\u30BF\u30A4\u30CA\u2026\u2026",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I... want to go... to the cake shop..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30CF\u30F3\u30DE\u30FC\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hammer?"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3093\uFF01\uFF1F\u3000\u4ECA\u306E\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u3060\u3088\u306D\uFF1F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hm!? That was you just now, wasn\u0027t it, Izana?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3042\u306F\u306F\u3001\u30D0\u30EC\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, you caught me"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u738B\u90FD\u306E\u751F\u5730\u5C4B",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The capital\u0027s fabric shop"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u9078\u629E\u80A2",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Selection"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u738B\u90FD\u306E\u751F\u5730\u5C4B\u3055\u3093\u306B\u884C\u304D\u305F\u3044\u306A\u3002\n\u30B9\u30AB\u30FC\u30C8\u304C\u307B\u3064\u308C\u3061\u3083\u3063\u305F\u304B\u3089\u3001\n\u7E55\u3046\u751F\u5730\u304C\u6B32\u3057\u304F\u3066",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I\u0027d like to go to the fabric shop in the capital.\nMy skirt has a tear, so\nI need some fabric to fix it"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u305D\u308C\u306A\u3089\u3001\u65B0\u3057\u3044\u306E\u4F5C\u3063\u3061\u3083\u304A\u3046\u3088\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In that case, let\u0027s make a new one!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u304C\u6620\u3048\u308B\u3088\u3046\u306B\u3001\n\u30EC\u30FC\u30B9\u3084\u30D5\u30EA\u30EB\u3092\u3064\u3051\u305F\u3044\u306A\uFF5E",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to add lace and frills\nto make you look even cuter~"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 79,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3058\u3083\u3042\u79C1\u306F\u3001\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA\u3061\u3083\u3093\u306B\n\u30EA\u30DC\u30F3\u306E\u4ED8\u3051\u895F\u3092\u4F5C\u3063\u3061\u3083\u3044\u307E\u3059\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then I\u0027ll make you a ribbon collar!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 80,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u3084\u3063\u305F\uFF01\u3000\u697D\u3057\u307F\uFF5E\uFF01",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yay! I can\u0027t wait~!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "\u30A4\u30B6\u30CA",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 81,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "\u30EC\u30B9\u30CA\u306E\u5BB6",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna\u0027s house"
        }
